Martinson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Batzer</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooper</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Forrester</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Allison</surname><given-names>DB</given-names></name><name><surname>Deka</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Ferrell</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><name><surname>Shriver</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Estimating African American admixture proportions by use of population-specific alleles</article-title><source>Am J Hum Genet</source><year>1998</year><volume>63</volume><fpage>1839</fpage><lpage>1851</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9837836</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1086/302148</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Oksenberg</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Barcellos</surname><given-names>LF</given-names></name><name><surname>Cree</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name><name><surname>Baranzini</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Bugawan</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name><name><surname>Khan</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Lincoln</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Swerdlin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Mignot</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Goodin</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Erlich</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmidt</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomson</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Reich</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Pericak-Vance</surna